invariant: INV-5
file: x509_pem.c
catches: pem_files_test
reason: x509_pem_parameters_are_p256 reads prime256v1's OID and does not
  require the DER to end there, so the OID with a byte after it names
  P-256. pem_files.c's room of 10 bytes refuses such a block before the
  check, so test_key_parameters asks the check itself about the OID with
  a zero byte after it.

--- old
    return x509_read_exact(&r, p256_parameters, sizeof p256_parameters) && rb_left(&r) == 0;
--- new
    return x509_read_exact(&r, p256_parameters, sizeof p256_parameters);
